l address", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 27384, "sub_id": 103, "type": "Ru-eks", "text": "maria@bolaget.se является адресом электронной почты", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 27384, "sub_id": 115, "type": "N-eks", "text": "kan jeg få e-postadressen din?", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 27384, "sub_id": 117, "type": "B-eks", "text": "can I have your e-mail address, please?", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 27384, "sub_id": 131, "type": "Ru-eks", "text": "можно мне получить адрес твоей электронной почты?", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 27384, "sub_id": 146, "type": "E-mor", "text": "en (ei) e-postadresse e-postadressen (e-postadressa) e-postadresser e-postadressene", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 27384, "sub_id": 150, "type": "E-alt", "text": "", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 27384, "sub_id": 153, "type": "E-utt", "text": "e:påstadrese", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 29358, "sub_id": 2, "type": "N-lem", "text": "domene~navn", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 29358, "sub_id": 4, "type": "B-lem", "text": "domain name", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 29358, "sub_id": 18, "type": "Ru-lem", "text": "доменное имя", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 29358, "sub_id": 30, "type": "N-kat", "text": "substantiv", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 29358, "sub_id": 31, "type": "B-kat", "text": "noun", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 29358, "sub_id": 45, "type": "Ru-kat", "text": "существительное", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 29358, "sub_id": 57, "type": "N-def", "text": "(i IT:) en del av en internett-adresse som oppgir land, institusjon, organisasjon eller nettverk, og ev. vertsmaskin innenfor nettverket", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 29358, "sub_id": 59, "type": "B-def", "text": "(IT:) a part of an Internet address denoting country, institution, organization or network, and sometimes the host computer within the network", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 29358, "sub_id": 73, "type": "Ru-def", "text": "(в IT) часть интернет-адреса, указывающая страну, учреждение, организацию или сеть и иногда хост-компьютер в сети", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 29358, "sub_id": 85, "type": "N-eks", "text": "bokstavkombinasjonen \"no\" i domenenavn står for Norge", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 29358, "sub_id": 87, "type": "B-eks", "text": "the letters \"no\" in domain names indicate Norway", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 29358, "sub_id": 101, "type": "Ru-eks", "text": "буквенная комбинация \"no\" в доменном имени означает Норвегию", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 29358, "sub_id": 113, "type": "N-mor", "text": "et domenenavn domenenavnet domenenavn domenenavnene (domenenavna)", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 29358, "sub_id": 116, "type": "N-utt", "text": "dom'e:nenavn", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 31384, "sub_id": 2, "type": "E-lem", "text": "nett~adresse", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 31384, "sub_id": 4, "type": "B-lem", "text": "web address", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 31384, "sub_id": 18, "type": "Ru-lem", "text": "сетевой адрес, веб-адрес, URL", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 31384, "sub_id": 31, "type": "E-kat", "text": "substantiv", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 31384, "sub_id": 32, "type": "B-kat", "text": "noun", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 31384, "sub_id": 46, "type": "Ru-kat", "text": "сущ.", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 31384, "sub_id": 59, "type": "E-def", "text": "", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 31384, "sub_id": 60, "type": "N-def", "text": "(i IKT:) en adresse (til en nettside) på internett, en web-adresse", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 31384, "sub_id": 62, "type": "B-def", "text": "(IT:) an address (usually for a web page) on the internet", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 31384, "sub_id": 76, "type": "Ru-def", "text": "(в IT) адрес веб-сайта в интернете", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 31384, "sub_id": 89, "type": "E-til", "text": "Nettadressen er plassert oppe i nettleservinduet og begynner ofte med med http.", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 31384, "sub_id": 91, "type": "B-til", "text": "The web address is located at the top of the browser window and often starts with http.", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 31384, "sub_id": 105, "type": "Ru-til", "text": "сетевой адрес виден в окне браузера и часто начинается с http:", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 31384, "sub_id": 117, "type": "N-div", "text": "bilde 20(461,492,506,490,506,506,464,506)", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 31384, "sub_id": 119, "type": "E-mor", "text": "en (ei) nettadresse nettadressen (nettadressa) nettadresser nettadressene", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}, {"id": 31384, "sub_id": 123, "type": "E-utt", "text": "netadrese", "index": null, "pri_id": null, "pri_text": ""}]], "resArray": {"0": {"id": 17}, "2": {"id": 6131}, "3": {"id": 27384}, "4": {"id": 6639}, "5": {"id": 31384}, "6": {"id": 5889}, "7": {"id": 14353}, "8": {"id": 29358}, "9": {"id": 3575}, "10": {"id": 6539}, "11": {"id": 2944}, "12": {"id": 1314}, "13": {"id": 6071}}}